<title>ZAIRE: Archbishop Monsengwo arrives in Zaire.</title>
<headline>Archbishop Monsengwo arrives in Zaire.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archbishop Laurent Monsengwo, tipped by some as a key player in any political settlement to Zaire's civil war, arrived in the capital Kinshasa on Monday, witnesses said.</p>
</text>
